{"unit_id":"charonomega__dsh-council-mode#card-zh","repo":"charonomega/dsh-council-mode","commit":"52fc112c2c394febc83e29219b72ce5a97bfe82f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Council Mode（议会模式）是一个面向 DSH 网页客户端的多智能体议会插件。它通过持久议题房间和 CLI Worker 成员，让多个智能体直接收取同伴消息并自主交流，主控无需逐条转述。用户可以邀请不同 CLI 和角色成员、发起或补充议题、暂停和恢复讨论，并查看成员发言与投递状态。议题消息和成员唤醒次数可配置，也可对单个议题启用不限次数。适合需要多角色协作讨论的 DSH 用户；需配置并登录所用 CLI 或模型账号，插件包内包含 CLI Worker。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:89-103","index.js:123-138","index.js:169-176","lib/room-service.js:1-10"]}
{"unit_id":"charonomega__dsh-council-mode#card-en","repo":"charonomega/dsh-council-mode","commit":"52fc112c2c394febc83e29219b72ce5a97bfe82f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Council Mode is a DSH web plugin for persistent, multi-agent discussions. Users invite CLI Worker members, start topics, and let agents message one another directly. The room supports pausing, resuming, and configurable message and wake limits. Configure the CLI or model accounts used by members.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:89-103","index.js:123-138","index.js:169-176","lib/room-service.js:1-10"]}
